Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:2px">Diffusion U-Net (noise predictor)</div>
<div style="font-size:11px;color:#444;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:4px">
  Drag the figure to ease the oblique shear out and see the true 3D block shapes;
  use <i>Figure view</i> to snap back to the printed projection.
</div>

